    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. regarding the 'remedies upon breach' part, can you expand on that? specifically i want to make sure we're protected if the supplier acts in bad faith or tries to hide delays in their production schedule. what kind of audit rights or monitoring clauses should we add to catch those kinds of issues before they become a huge problem?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
