      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To counter bad faith and concealed delays, incorporate explicit audit rights allowing you periodic access to their relevant production records and inventory logs. You should also include strict notification requirements, mandating immediate written disclosure of any potential production risks or delays. Consider adding clauses that empower you to conduct joint site visits or performance reviews to proactively monitor compliance with agreed schedules.",
      "source": "target",
